{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260dWvfX62fA1795418791.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。鄺港傑的代表律師，之後提及鄺港智證供中，曾指在車上跟蔡天鳳說，指如果不讓鄺球見孫兒，鄺球就甚麼都不配合。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI.SSS 1500.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266Ewx68BfaG1795418817.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>鄺港智指蔡天鳳當時感到生氣，要求鄺港傑致電鄺球，並詢問他在哪。得知在大埔後，蔡天鳳指要「即刻講清楚」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI.SSS 1500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aF7nb1d2hB1795418836.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>律師又質疑鄺港智，因被蔡天鳳責罵而失控襲擊，鄺港智指，被蔡天鳳長期責罵是「情趣」，否認因怒火殺死蔡天鳳。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI.SSS 1500_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nGPF0iuusC1795418853.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>對於早前提及鄺球有情婦，蔡天鳳曾指罵「 臨老入花叢」，律師質疑鄺港智虛構證供，鄺港智否認。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:32:42.907746+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T07:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T10:17:16.501969+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:04.570533+00:00","content_hash":"ccbb7d26d4308769f1eba3088c67b3ad06f088dc87538c1dd9e5d4f5f3d80d08","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}